<title>SWITZERLAND: Bertelsmann sells Swiss phone book stake.</title>
<headline>Bertelsmann sells Swiss phone book stake.</headline>
<dateline>LAUSANNE, Switzerland 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>German media giant Bertelsmann AG has sold its 55 percent stake in a Swiss telephone book producer to Swiss advertising group Publicitas Holding AG, a joint statement said.</p>
<p>Publicitas said the deal for control of LTV AG, which has annual sales of about 50 million Swiss francs, would take effect as of December 1 pending final approval by the boards of Publicitas and Bertelsmann.</p>
<p>Publicitas said LTV's business in producing local telephone directories would compliment its own sideline in business telephone directories. -- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
